                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Zum Mittag — Falls mindestens drei Regionen mit einem Geländetyp sichtbar sind, darfst du einem Charakter deiner Wahl in der Reserve #2 Verstärkungen# geben.",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "At Noon — If three or more single-terrain regions are visible, you may give #2 boosts# to target Character in Reserve.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "A mezzogiorno — Se sono visibili tre o più regioni con un unico tipo di terreno, puoi conferire #2 rinforzi# a un personaggio bersaglio nella Riserva.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "À Midi — Si au moins trois régions mono-terrain sont visibles, vous pouvez donner #2 boosts# à un Personnage ciblé en Réserve.",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Al mediodía — Si tres o más regiones monoterreno son visibles, puedes dar #2 potenciadores# a un personaje objetivo en reserva.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  }
                },
                "text": "At Noon — If three or more single-terrain regions are visible, you may give #2 boosts# to target Character in Reserve."
              }
            ],
            "reference": "01510"
          },
          "sequence": 1,
          "id": "01KGQDMETQG4CS7YQ517D2N7B4"
        }
